3. REMOVED FROM THE UPSTREAM WORK
---------------------------------

3.1 The track, and its CC-BY attribution

The upstream 3D map was:

    "Desert Race Game Prototype Map V2" by Batuhan13
    https://sketchfab.com/3d-models/desert-race-game-prototype-map-v2-2ccd3dcbd197415d9f1b97c30b1248c5
    Licensed CC-BY-4.0

It has been replaced in full by the procedurally generated circuit described in
section 4, and every trace of it has been deleted:

    public/models/track-draco.glb        the baked map (track, terrain,
                                         mountains, water, birds, clouds and
                                         the locomotive)
    public/textures/heightmap_1024.png   the cannon Heightfield the car drove on
    assets/track.blend                   the Blender source for the map
    src/models/track/Track.tsx           the mesh-by-mesh renderer for it
    src/models/track/Heightmap.tsx       the Heightfield builder
    src/models/track/Train.tsx           the level's scripted train
    src/models/Ramp.tsx                  a jump placed for the desert layout
    public/sounds/water.mp3              played by the map's lake
    public/sounds/train.mp3              played by the train

No part of that asset is used or shipped, so its CC-BY-4.0 attribution no
longer applies to this work and has been removed along with it. The same
deletion removes a second CC-BY-4.0 asset that was baked into the same file,
"Train, Locomotive SD40-2" by NIKCORE
(https://sketchfab.com/3d-models/train-locomotive-sd40-2-bdeadf60bf774adc9a39c744792c02c4).

The vehicle .glb files are NOT affected by this — see section 2, their CC-BY
attribution stands.

3.2 The multiplayer server

The fork added a Colyseus backend, and the client refused to render anything at
all until it had joined a room on ws://localhost:2567. We do not run that
server, so the whole layer is gone:

    server/                              the Colyseus server and its schema
    MULTIPLAYER.md                       its documentation
    src/network/OpponentListComponent.tsx
    src/models/vehicle/OpponentVehicle.tsx
    src/models/vehicle/OpponentChassis.tsx
    src/ui/Rank.tsx                      the multiplayer ranking table
    public/models/chassis-animator-draco.glb   used only by opponent cars

src/network/api.ts is now a local single-player stand-in that keeps the same
shape the rest of the code expects (`gameRoom.sessionId`, a players map with
onAdd/onRemove, and a `send()` that does nothing), so the game boots offline.
The `colyseus.js` dependency has been dropped.

3.3 The hosted leaderboard and OAuth sign-in

src/data.ts talked to a Supabase project whose URL and anonymous key were
hard-coded in the source, and src/ui/Auth.tsx offered Google and GitHub OAuth so
players could post scores to it. That is somebody else's backend. src/data.ts
has been rewritten to keep lap times in localStorage, and these were deleted:

    src/ui/Auth.tsx
    src/ui/Finished.tsx                  the post-race score-submission screen

The `@supabase/supabase-js` dependency has been dropped. Nothing in this
directory now makes a network request.

